Include: include/setup.vader

Given:
  [iCopy][iCut][iPaste]
  [iSendToBack][iSendBack][iSendForward][iSendToFront]
  [Foo][Bar]

Execute (justify between cells):
  %EasyAlign */]/ { 'justify': 'between' }

Expect:
  [iCopy]                [iCut]               [iPaste]
  [iSendToBack][iSendBack][iSendForward][iSendToFront]
  [Foo]                                          [Bar]

Execute (justify cells with left-aligned contents):
  %EasyAlign */]/ { 'justify': 'cells', 'align': 'l' }

Expect:
  [iCopy          ][iCut           ][iPaste          ]
  [iSendToBack][iSendBack][iSendForward][iSendToFront]
  [Foo                     ][Bar                     ]

Execute (justify cells with centered contents):
  %EasyAlign */]/ { 'justify': 'cells', 'align': 'c' }

Expect:
  [     iCopy     ][     iCut      ][     iPaste     ]
  [iSendToBack][iSendBack][iSendForward][iSendToFront]
  [          Foo           ][          Bar           ]

Execute (justify shorthand):
  %EasyAlign */]/jb

Expect:
  [iCopy]                [iCut]               [iPaste]
  [iSendToBack][iSendBack][iSendForward][iSendToFront]
  [Foo]                                          [Bar]

Execute (justify cells and alignment shorthand):
  %EasyAlign */]/jcal

Expect:
  [iCopy          ][iCut           ][iPaste          ]
  [iSendToBack][iSendBack][iSendForward][iSendToFront]
  [Foo                     ][Bar                     ]

Given:
  [iCopy][iCut][iPaste]
  [iSendToBack][iSendBack][iSendForward][iSendToFront]
  [Foo][Bar]

Do (interactive justify between cells):
  vip
  \<Enter>\<C-J>*\<C-X>]\<Enter>

Expect:
  [iCopy]                [iCut]               [iPaste]
  [iSendToBack][iSendBack][iSendForward][iSendToFront]
  [Foo]                                          [Bar]

Given:
  [iCopy][iCut][iPaste]
  [iSendToBack][iSendBack][iSendForward][iSendToFront]
  [Foo][Bar]

Do (live interactive justify between cells):
  vip
  \<Space>\<Enter>\<C-J>*\<C-X>]\<Enter>\<C-X>

Expect:
  [iCopy]                [iCut]               [iPaste]
  [iSendToBack][iSendBack][iSendForward][iSendToFront]
  [Foo]                                          [Bar]

Given:
  [iCopy][iCut][iPaste]
  [iSendToBack][iSendBack][iSendForward][iSendToFront]
  [Foo][Bar]

Do (interactive justify centered cells):
  vip
  \<Enter>\<Enter>\<Enter>\<C-J>\<C-J>*\<C-X>]\<Enter>

Expect:
  [     iCopy     ][     iCut      ][     iPaste     ]
  [iSendToBack][iSendBack][iSendForward][iSendToFront]
  [          Foo           ][          Bar           ]

Given:
  [12345678901234567890][x]
  [veryveryverylong][x][y]

Execute (long cells are never truncated):
  %EasyAlign */]/ { 'justify': 'cells' }

Expect:
  [12345678901234567890][x]
  [veryveryverylong][x][y ]
